  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>According to Doppler&#39;s effect, the approximate frequency heard by the stationary observer,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p>Case (I)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Speed of sound in air,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>Speed of source,&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math> frequency of the source.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mn>306</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Case (ii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mn>323</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>From Eq. (i) and (ii), we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>306</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>323</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>323</mn><mn>306</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
